*  CLASS (b) IN BEAUTY'S OWN SHAPE -- beauty's Commands (line 217) verbatim:
*      Commands = *Command FENCE(*Commands | epsilon)
*  with Command given real alternatives, which is what beauty's Command has.  The left element's
*  alternatives are exactly what the wholesale seal throws away.  beauty's X4 (line 128) is the same
*  shape one element wider.
          Command = 'a' | 'ab'
          Commands = *Command FENCE(*Commands | epsilon)
          'ab' POS(0) *Commands RPOS(0)         :S(OK)F(NO)
OK        OUTPUT = 'match'                      :(END)
NO        OUTPUT = 'nomatch'
END
